ave ever met in my entire life. She told me they decided to close early because they didn't have enough business that particular day, and after telling her I had just spent $70 ubering there and that they still had an hour and 15 minutes until closing, as mentioned on their website, she told me thats \"too bad\" and I should find somewhere else to eat, and then proceeded to slam the door in my face. I will never be returning to this restaurant EVER again, and I highly advise that you take your money and time and spend it at a small local restaurant in Downtown SB, where there is plenty of delicious food and small local businesss that actually WANT, and need, your customer service."},{"review_date":"2022-01-05 04:25:36","review_stars":1.0,"review_text":"Terrible customer service. Especially the hostess. They advertise being open until 9, arrived an hour early (with respect of not wanting to stay past closing) and was told we could not be seated. I suggest advertising correct business hours and expecting costumer dissatisfaction when not seated during restaurant hours. In addition when we expressed confusion we were helped by one of the rudest hostesses I have come across (being a hostess myself) . Insanely unprofessional. Will not be returning and suggest to others to not check this place out. A much cheaper and friendlier taco restaurant down the street that actually deserves your business."}],"state":"CA"}
